  "description": "Minimal cross-platform audio engine for .NET desktop apps (Windows, Linux, macOS), built on a native Rust core. Audio in and out only: playback, recording, multi-track mixing, effects and VST3 hosting. Everything that could be left out is left out - no analysis features, no ONNX models, no UI dependency - so it stays a fraction of the full package size. AOT-compatible and trimmable.",
